/-!
# A155161

A Fibonacci convolution triangle: Riordan array (1, x/(1 - x - x^2)). Triangle T(n,k), 0 <= k <= n, read by rows.

The 78 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A155161

